    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 1: Fetch information about tables and create copies\nWe use custom HTTP requests in order to access `/meta` endpoints. Learn more about NocoDB meta APIs [here](https://nocodb.com/apis/v3/meta)",
        "height": 576,
        "width": 832,
        "color": 7
